From 6807847b17c61cf82bd260aeb3e03460fc859085 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chen Xiaohui <graych@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 18 May 2026 18:27:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 04/11] virtio-devices: preserve balloon release notifications
 before sparse reclaim

Notify logically released ranges before sparse reclaim and propagate errors. On 4 KiB hosts, sort and coalesce at most 8192 PFNs per chunk of a cold-created balloon inflate descriptor. Select from top-level VM creation provenance before extracting optional child snapshots. Preserve the per-PFN restore and partial-host-page paths.
